- Chameleon Ultra — https://github.com/RfidResearchGroup/ChameleonUltra
  Firmware, protocol, and CLI for the Chameleon Ultra/Lite device. GPL-3.0.

Additions in this fork
----------------------
- Per-card capture location (geotag) and photos, stored in an on-disk "case
  folder" alongside a generated Markdown report.
- Engagement/authorization metadata for traceable, report-ready records.
- Flipper Zero interoperability: export saved cards to Flipper .nfc (HF:
  Mifare Classic / Ultralight / NTAG) and .rfid (LF: EM4100 family) files.
- Shareable self-contained case bundles (.zip) that import on another install.

Intended use
------------
This tool is intended for authorized security testing and research only. Every
captured card should be tied to an engagement scope you are contracted to test.
